						"analysis": "Package: Jinja2 (whl)\nVersion: 3.1.6\nDescription: A very fast and expressive template engine.\n\nThe provided source code is a legitimate NVDA screen reader plugin ('AI-assistant') that bundles Jinja2 v3.1.6 alongside helper libraries (Pygments, Markdown, latex2mathml). It integrates screen-reading context collection (UI automation text extraction and screen capture) with local and cloud LLM providers (Ollama, LiteRT-LM, OpenAI, Gemini). Sensitive user credentials like API keys are encrypted locally using Windows DPAPI. No malicious behavior, secret exfiltration, or unauthorized execution was detected.",
